Feature slices live here, one directory per user-facing capability
(catalogue, cart, checkout, orders, preorder, pickup, reviews, auth, profile).

Per SDD 25.3 each feature owns:

  features/<name>/
    api.ts          RTK Query endpoints injected into the shared baseApi slice
    components/     presentational + container components
    hooks/          feature-local hooks
    types.ts        feature-local types

A feature may import from `shared/`, never from another feature. The ESLint
config enforces this. Cross-feature needs get lifted into `shared/` or composed
at the page level.

No feature is implemented in this scaffold by design.
